{
    "title": "GPS Speedometer - Odometer App",
    "description": "GPS speedometer and odometer will measure the speed of any kind of transportation. In the speed meter app speed limit is displayed on both analog and digital values . This train speed live meter app shows the velocity of the vehicle on different scales. The Gps Speedometer app for motorcycle will measure your travel speed and when the speed limit exceeds alarm will start buzzing. A HUD Speedometer mph and speed meter app shows the speed of your vehicle just like your car speed, and a digital odometer will show you the car speed in digits. Car speedometer offline app can track time, speed, distance and your current location. Train speed live meter App support different speed unit like miles per hour (mph), miles per hour (km), and knots.\r\n\r\nThe most accurate speedometer app will help you to keep track of the road when you traveled while driving or jogging. When you used the digital Speedometer mph with the map it will also provide GPS navigation.\r\n \r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca2 GPS speedometer and odometer have a simple and attractive user interface.\r\n\u27bf The car speedometer app works offline, so if you don\u2019t have an internet connection you can use this app offline as well. \r\n\ud83c\udf00 Head up display HUD speedometer offline app is very simple and easy to use.\r\n\ud83d\udca0 Digital speedometer measures the distance meter and speed meter.\r\n\u2744\ufe0f GPS speed tracker app also shows speed in notification and you can also enable/disable tracking on map.\r\n\ud83c\udf10 Measure travel speed (driving, biking, walking or jogging) by GPS speed app.\r\n\ud83c\udf87 Digital Speedometer mph display HUD with accurate speed & you can also use it for GPS navigation. \r\n\ud83d\udd17 GPS speedometer odometer app will show you the average speed, maximum speed, and GPS measure distance meter accurately. \r\n\ud83d\udcae Set a speed limit and when you go beyond your limits this app will give you dangerous alerts.\r\n\ud83d\udca5 train speed live meter app gives you the ability to choose multiple colors to display.\r\n\ud83d\udd31 Speed can be displayed in one of three different units (kph) kilometer per hour (mph) miles per hour and (knots).\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Turn on/off vibration when the alarm ringing.\r\n\ud83c\udf37 GPS speedometer and odometer are small in size and uses very little battery. \r\n\u2b55 Digital speedometer car app helps you to keep track of the road while driving or walking\r\n\ud83c\udf86 You can set your desired unit and you can also change the unit at any time. \r\n\ud83c\udf20 Portrait and landscape are the two (heads up display) HUD speedometer mode which helps you while traveling and driving a car.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e You can easily show or hide the clock from the display screen.\r\n\ud83c\udf80 Download the free GPS Speedometer app for motorcycles, see speed & GPS measure distance meter and it will ensure your safety when it comes to traffic.\r\n\r\nGPS speed meter app will help you to switch between scales of measurement and it will also track your trip by GPS speed tracking. Through GPS Speedometer offline you can track velocity while cycling, driving, running, flying and sailing, etc. You can easily track the speed of your train within a few seconds with the train speed live meter & speedometer app. \r\n\r\nTracking:\r\n \ud83d\uddef Speed Tracker: Track accurate speed in Kmph mode, mph mode, or knots.\r\n\ud83c\udf87 Time Tracking: You can check the time of your trip.\r\n\ud83c\udf40 Location: Easily check the location of your route.\r\n\ud83c\udf84 Distance Tracking: Track your distance meters.\r\n\ud83c\udf40 Train speed live meter: Track live speed of train.\r\nWhile using the GPS Speedometer mph you can also play music in the background. With a free bike speedometer offline app you can test your run, walk, and any sort of speed. GPS speed meter app works quickly even if you don\u2019t have an internet connection. You can use it on your bike and your cycle. With this train speed live meter app you can check the speed of train. With the Speedometer app for motorcycles, you can easily measure the average speed and maximum speed. This is an amazing GPS speedometer and odometer app for cars.",
    "descriptionHTML": "GPS speedometer and odometer will measure the speed of any kind of transportation. In the speed meter app speed limit is displayed on both analog and digital values . This train speed live meter app shows the velocity of the vehicle on different scales. The Gps Speedometer app for motorcycle will measure your travel speed and when the speed limit exceeds alarm will start buzzing. A HUD Speedometer mph and speed meter app shows the speed of your vehicle just like your car speed, and a digital odometer will show you the car speed in digits. Car speedometer offline app can track time, speed, distance and your current location. Train speed live meter App support different speed unit like miles per hour (mph), miles per hour (km), and knots.<br><br>The most accurate speedometer app will help you to keep track of the road when you traveled while driving or jogging. When you used the digital Speedometer mph with the map it will also provide GPS navigation.<br> <br>Features:<br><br>\ud83d\udca2 GPS speedometer and odometer have a simple and attractive user interface.<br>\u27bf The car speedometer app works offline, so if you don\u2019t have an internet connection you can use this app offline as well. <br>\ud83c\udf00 Head up display HUD speedometer offline app is very simple and easy to use.<br>\ud83d\udca0 Digital speedometer measures the distance meter and speed meter.<br>\u2744\ufe0f GPS speed tracker app also shows speed in notification and you can also enable/disable tracking on map.<br>\ud83c\udf10 Measure travel speed (driving, biking, walking or jogging) by GPS speed app.<br>\ud83c\udf87 Digital Speedometer mph display HUD with accurate speed &amp; you can also use it for GPS navigation. <br>\ud83d\udd17 GPS speedometer odometer app will show you the average speed, maximum speed, and GPS measure distance meter accurately. <br>\ud83d\udcae Set a speed limit and when you go beyond your limits this app will give you dangerous alerts.<br>\ud83d\udca5 train speed live meter app gives you the ability to choose multiple colors to display.<br>\ud83d\udd31 Speed can be displayed in one of three different units (kph) kilometer per hour (mph) miles per hour and (knots).<br>\ud83d\udc8e Turn on/off vibration when the alarm ringing.<br>\ud83c\udf37 GPS speedometer and odometer are small in size and uses very little battery. <br>\u2b55 Digital speedometer car app helps you to keep track of the road while driving or walking<br>\ud83c\udf86 You can set your desired unit and you can also change the unit at any time. <br>\ud83c\udf20 Portrait and landscape are the two (heads up display) HUD speedometer mode which helps you while traveling and driving a car.<br>\ud83d\udc8e You can easily show or hide the clock from the display screen.<br>\ud83c\udf80 Download the free GPS Speedometer app for motorcycles, see speed &amp; GPS measure distance meter and it will ensure your safety when it comes to traffic.<br><br>GPS speed meter app will help you to switch between scales of measurement and it will also track your trip by GPS speed tracking. Through GPS Speedometer offline you can track velocity while cycling, driving, running, flying and sailing, etc. You can easily track the speed of your train within a few seconds with the train speed live meter &amp; speedometer app. <br><br>Tracking:<br> \ud83d\uddef Speed Tracker: Track accurate speed in Kmph mode, mph mode, or knots.<br>\ud83c\udf87 Time Tracking: You can check the time of your trip.<br>\ud83c\udf40 Location: Easily check the location of your route.<br>\ud83c\udf84 Distance Tracking: Track your distance meters.<br>\ud83c\udf40 Train speed live meter: Track live speed of train.<br>While using the GPS Speedometer mph you can also play music in the background. With a free bike speedometer offline app you can test your run, walk, and any sort of speed. GPS speed meter app works quickly even if you don\u2019t have an internet connection. You can use it on your bike and your cycle. With this train speed live meter app you can check the speed of train. With the Speedometer app for motorcycles, you can easily measure the average speed and maximum speed. This is an amazing GPS speedometer and odometer app for cars.",
